          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Whether you're a keen student of vengeance or you picked up techniques after being a common target for the sisters' punishment, you've learned to dig painfully into your opponent's flesh. In this stance, you can make fury's fang unarmed attacks. These deal 1d6 piercing damage; are in the brawling group; and have the agile, backstabber, finesse, forceful, nonlethal, and unarmed traits.</p>\n<p>While in the stance, if you critically hit with a melee Strike that deals piercing damage, the target is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Sickened]{Sickened 1} (with a DC to remove equal to your class DC); this is in addition to any critical specialization effect you might gain from the attack.</p>"
          },
